            "paragraph": "The four climate models are the Met Office Hadley Centre ESM (HadGEM2-ES, Collins et al., 2011), the Institut Pierre Simon Laplace ESM (IPSL-CM5A, Dufresne et al., 2012), the Max Planck Institute ESM (MPI-ESM, Giorgetta et al., 2012), and the Norwegian ESM (NorESM, Alterskj\u00e6r et al., 2012). The main characteristics of these models are given in Table 1.",
